{"id":"liderazgo","lemma":"liderazgo","pos":"noun","rank":4174,"glosses":["leadership"],"ipa":"/lideˈɾaθɡo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"liderazgos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c5/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-liderazgo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Se necesitaba un liderazgo fuerte.","en":"Strong leadership was needed.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/641933","words":[{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to need","l":"necesitar"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"strong"}]},{"text":"Él asumió el liderazgo del partido político.","en":"He assumed the leadership of the political party.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to assume, take on","l":"asumir"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"of the"},null,null],"phrases":[[5,7,"political party"]]},{"text":"El liderazgo moral es más fuerte que cualquier arma.","en":"Moral leadership is more powerful than any weapon.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"moral"},null,null,{"g":"strong"},{"g":"that"},null,{"g":"weapon, arm"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"furthermore"]]}]}